{
  "$comment": "Bharat's Claude Code setup. MERGE this into your user-global ~/.claude/settings.json so it applies in every directory. extraKnownMarketplaces makes marketplaces installable; enabledPlugins turns them on everywhere. ecc, probity (TDD/rule enforcement), memsearch (semantic session memory), openai-codex (cross-model reviews), and the non-default trailofbits plugins are registered but intentionally NOT enabled — one '/plugin install' away (see README cheatsheet). agent-teams@claude-code-workflows is explicitly disabled: it still calls the TeamCreate/TeamDelete tools removed in Claude Code v2.1.178 (Jun 2026).",
